{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00020","headline":"青溪（一作过青溪水作） · 王维","name":"青溪（一作过青溪水作）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"> 言入黄花川，每逐青溪水。\n> 随山将万转，趣途无百里。\n> 声喧乱石中，色静深松里。\n> 漾漾泛菱荇，澄澄星影已。\n> 我心素已闲，清川澹如此。\n> 请留盘石上，垂钓将已矣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/curated_00020.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00020","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于据萧涤非《唐诗鉴赏辞典》“青溪”条（上海辞书出版社，1983 年版）、与开放语料未能唯一对齐，保留为整理本异文/组诗条目","citation":"据萧涤非《唐诗鉴赏辞典》“青溪”条（上海辞书出版社，1983 年版）"}